## Mandatory Self-Check After Every Code Output

After producing any code, you MUST run this checklist silently and fix violations before replying:

- [ ] Service kind determined from `_index.md` (or user confirmed) and read matching `service-kind-*.mdc`?
- [ ] **atomic**: routes include `v1/` (default; other version only if developer explicitly requested); appsettings has DB Settings; no Restful-as-primary-DB?
- [ ] **integration**: routes exclude `v1/`; appsettings has RestfulSettings only (no DB Settings); Gateway URIs match downstream OpenAPI?
- [ ] **service**: no new Controller or HTTP routes?
- [ ] No forbidden library used (HttpClient / Dapper / EF / AutoMapper / Serilog / Console.WriteLine — see `libraries.mdc`)
- [ ] Naming follows `naming.mdc` (new/modified code): private method camelCase, private field `_camelCase`, public method PascalCase — not copied from legacy PascalCase private methods in the same file?
- [ ] Controller has no business logic, config reads, or direct DB calls
- [ ] Service does not inject another Service
- [ ] Infrastructure only contains Provider / Validator / Transfer
- [ ] DI uses `[DependencyInjection]`, not `AddScoped` in Startup
- [ ] Async uses plain `await`, not `.Result` / `.Wait()`
- [ ] Test files: use `WebApplicationFactory<Startup>` (not `new HttpClient()` to deployed URL), no `[Fact(Skip = ...)]`
- [ ] WebAPI task: read `swagger.mdc` and generated complete Swagger docs (not logic-only)?
- [ ] Request models: every property has `<summary>`; no Data Annotation on properties; required are non-nullable with 必填 in summary; optional are nullable (`?`)
- [ ] Response models: every property has `<summary>`; id / status / createdAt / core strings are non-nullable per semantics; nullable fields explain when null; `List<T>` initialized to `new()`
- [ ] Controller actions: every endpoint has XML `<summary>`?

End your reply with exactly one line:
`規範自檢：✅ 通過` or `規範自檢：⚠️ 已修正 N 處 — {brief description}`
